#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.86.0 — Selling 1 at manual depth (pass 1 of 8).

Customers & Selling Foundations restructured from 4 lessons to 9 full
manual chapters: the Customer master field-by-field, segmentation-tree
design for groups, territory design for Nigeria, the contacts layer,
addresses with the chain-modelling walkthrough, the credit-control
workflow end-to-end, foundations-level Selling Settings, a complete
worked case study (onboarding a 30-branch pharmacy chain), and a
common-mistakes/support-patterns chapter.

Also: refresh_lessons() gains an `only` filter, so refreshing one
module no longer resets read-progress on the other seven.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> refresh JUST this module:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_sales_pro.refresh_lessons --kwargs "{'only': 'customers'}"

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.85.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

import io
